# duplicate-exception-handler (#7): two 'on <Class>' clauses for the same class in
# one try's except -- the second is unreachable. Fires on the second EConvertError
# (line 12); NOT on the first EConvertError (line 10) nor the distinct
# EAccessViolation (line 11).
duplicate-exception-handler 12
!duplicate-exception-handler 10
!duplicate-exception-handler 11
